Now I can see the exact format. The `timeAgo()` function returns:
- `"never"` if no timestamp
- `"just now"` if < 45 seconds
- `"N min ago"` if < 60 minutes
- `"N h ago"` if < 24 hours
- `"N d ago"` for days

And popup.js formats it as:
- `"Last sync: {timeAgo} · {count} page(s)"` when successful
- `"Last sync: never"` when never synced
- `"Sync problem: {error}"` on error

